# Transient handoff docs — gitignored by default so day-to-day notes
# don't pollute the repo. To share a specific handoff with co-workers,
# commit it explicitly with `git add -f docs/handoffs/temp/<file>` on
# the active branch (NOT on main). The branch is the shared surface;
# the file gets dropped from the branch before merging to main.
# See docs/handoffs/README.md for the convention.
/docs/handoffs/temp/
